{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Game Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/2950bd722ff9d6935ec976e89ab9392f.avif?t=1763645051\" width=1300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls everywhere, bombs flying, absolute chaos... sound like a dream? Well, it's not anymore! Atomic Blastman is here, and it\u2019s a modern, souped-up remake of that legendary 1997 bomb-blasting hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to blast through blocks, trick your rivals, and just try to stay alive as the whole map explodes around you. Play alone, or dive into huge online matches with tons of players across awesome modes like Classic or Battle Royale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember -\u00a0<strong>be the last one standing</strong> to earn a <strong>bonus powerup and extra XP</strong>, giving you a head start when you jump back into the arena later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/3d1fe334526560c00444ae0359cfa066.poster.avif?t=1763645051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/3d1fe334526560c00444ae0359cfa066.webm?t=1763645051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/3d1fe334526560c00444ae0359cfa066.mp4?t=1763645051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge arenas supporting up to 32 players</strong>, packed with chaos, explosions, and nonstop action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crossplay between Epic and Steam</strong>, so everyone can play together no matter the platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI bots powered by a live-training neural network</strong> that constantly learn and improve as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New powerups and updated game mechanics</strong> that keep every match fresh and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the last player standing</strong> to win the round - and the first to win all rounds earns a <strong>bonus powerup</strong> at the start of their next match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully customizable levels</strong> thanks to the built-in arena editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both singleplayer and online multiplayer</strong> modes available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New arena sudden-death mechanic</strong> that pushes every match to an explosive finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match leaver punishment system</strong> to keep the game fair for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes\u2026 <strong>funny diseased sounds and goofy sound effects</strong> to make the chaos even better.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/4f2b588d3b06888734b5556e6b331186.poster.avif?t=1763645051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/4f2b588d3b06888734b5556e6b331186.webm?t=1763645051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/4f2b588d3b06888734b5556e6b331186.mp4?t=1763645051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Custom Map Editor</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place <strong>any cubes</strong> you want, anywhere you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop <strong>any power-up</strong> exactly where you want it to spawn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena skin comes with its own cube variations -\u00a0<strong>pick and paint</strong> with any of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build arenas using <strong>custom objects</strong> you\u2019ve unlocked or purchased from the in-game shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, load, update, and delete any map you\u2019ve stored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or generate a <strong>random map</strong> instantly and start editing from there.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/c630a6acf03efbe6f4ffcfa9ebd93dc5.poster.avif?t=1763645051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/c630a6acf03efbe6f4ffcfa9ebd93dc5.webm?t=1763645051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/c630a6acf03efbe6f4ffcfa9ebd93dc5.mp4?t=1763645051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0The Atomic Blastman In-Game Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><u>(Atomic Blastman offers style, not power! Everything in the shop is cosmetic only)</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full customization for the whole game: arenas, character skins, emotes, icons, banners, game themes, player intros, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP by playing matches and spend it directly in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items can be purchased with <strong>XP</strong> or with <strong>BC (Blast Coins)</strong>, the official Atomic Blastman currency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop supports microtransactions for players who want to pick things up faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth browsing experience with fast previews and clean category navigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store is <strong>regularly updated</strong> with new assets, rotating items, seasonal drops, and limited-time offers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras/43deb653f544de7801fa9235003b7a26.avif?t=1763645051\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/extras_big/43deb653f544de7801fa9235003b7a26.webp?t=1763645051 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>So what are you waiting for? Wishlist the game now and let\u2019s build the Blastman community together.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4142990?t=1763645051","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/9bcec90cae31094d459545f830ced188189080e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763645051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/f820606c5c7cd76e791808fb115ab0d329f5c8e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763645051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/f820606c5c7cd76e791808fb115ab0d3